It does NOT cover, and this repository makes NO claim over, the original
Magisk module "神秘啊神秘" / SingBox_For_Magisk, authored by Puer_Nya
(https://github.com/PuerNya). That includes, but is not limited to:

  - sfm/singBox        custom sing-box kernel (PuerNya fork)
  - sfm/bundle         Node.js dashboard / config service
  - sfm/converter      config migration tool
  - handle, keycheck   helper binaries
  - base.apk           bundled companion app
  - customize.sh, service.sh, post-fs-data.sh, uninstall.sh
