Those files are redistributed here VERBATIM (byte-identical to the original,
verifiable by sha256) solely so that this modified configuration can be
flashed and used directly. All rights remain with their original author.

Third-party rule-set data referenced by URL in the configuration belongs to
their respective projects; see CREDITS.md for the full list.

